  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_BERSERK_HAND33_INTRO",
    "effect": [
      {
        "u_message": "The path ends abruptly, as though the world itself decided where to stop it. The space ahead resembles neither forest nor cave nor anything familiar: light comes from nowhere and everywhere at once, casting no shadows.\n\nFive figures stand in a semicircle. None steps forward. They wait, as though approaching were your decision.\n\nA heavy pulse beats in your palm, though the stone is no longer there.\n\nVoid: \"The call was heard. You have reached the place where you may give your answer.\"",
        "type": "warning",
        "popup": true
      },
      {
        "math": [
          "u_berserk_hand33_scene_seen = 1"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "condition": {
      "and": [
        {
          "test_eoc": "EOC_BERSERK_APOSTOL_CEREMONY_OPEN"
        },
        {
          "not": {
            "math": [
              "u_berserk_hand33_scene_seen == 1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_BERSERK_HAND33_COMBAT_LINES",
    "effect": {
      "if": {
        "and": [
          "has_beta",
          "npc_is_monster",
          {
            "math": [
              "n_monsters_nearby('mon_berserk_godhand_void', 'radius': 0, 'attitude': 'both') > 0"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "u_message": "Void: You turned your actions against those whose answer you still awaited.\n\nThe five voices fall silent. At the beginning of the path, the closed passage tears open.",
        "type": "bad",
        "popup": false
      },
      "else": {
        "if": {
          "and": [
            "has_beta",
            "npc_is_monster",
            {
              "math": [
                "n_monsters_nearby('mon_berserk_godhand_slan', 'radius': 0, 'attitude': 'both') > 0"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "then": {
          "u_message": "Slan: So that is how you chose to express your desire. Very well. We shall see.\n\nThe five voices fall silent. At the beginning of the path, the closed passage tears open.",
          "type": "bad",
          "popup": false
        },
        "else": {
          "if": {
            "and": [
              "has_beta",
              "npc_is_monster",
              {
                "math": [
                  "n_monsters_nearby('mon_berserk_godhand_ubik', 'radius': 0, 'attitude': 'both') > 0"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "u_message": "Ubik: Now we'll see whether you can reach the road back.\n\nThe five voices fall silent. At the beginning of the path, the closed passage tears open.",
            "type": "bad",
            "popup": false
          },
          "else": {
            "if": {
              "and": [
                "has_beta",
                "npc_is_monster",
                {
                  "math": [
                    "n_monsters_nearby('mon_berserk_godhand_conrad', 'radius': 0, 'attitude': 'both') > 0"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "u_message": "He turns his whole body toward you, slowly, like everything he does. He speaks no further word.\n\nThe five voices fall silent. At the beginning of the path, the closed passage tears open.",
              "type": "bad",
              "popup": false
            },
            "else": {
              "if": {
                "and": [
                  "has_beta",
                  "npc_is_monster",
                  {
                    "math": [
                      "n_monsters_nearby('mon_berserk_godhand_femto', 'radius': 0, 'attitude': 'both') > 0"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "u_message": "Femto: Not enough.\n\nThe five voices fall silent. At the beginning of the path, the closed passage tears open.",
                "type": "bad",
                "popup": false
              },
              "else": {
                "u_message": "The five voices fall silent. At the beginning of the path, the closed passage tears open.",
                "type": "bad",
                "popup": false
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "condition": {
      "and": [
        {
          "and": [
            "u_is_avatar",
            {
              "math": [
                "u_berserk_eclipse_route == 2"
              ]
            },
